1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,580
Every commuter knows the sprint for Caltrain.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:10,900
Here is how Headway puts your exact departures, leave-by times, and live alerts on your wrist and your glasses.

3
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:16,050
Open Headway on your phone, and save your morning and evening commute stations.

4
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:21,100
The Trains tab instantly loads live departures with real-time delays.

5
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:28,250
Instead of doing platform mental math, the Catch card counts down to the exact minute you must walk out your door.

6
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,130
Green means you are on time; if you need to hustle, it warns you to run.

7
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:38,280
To take it hands-free, generate a six-digit pairing code in the Glasses tab.

8
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:43,580
Type it into your Even app once. Now your commute board floats right before your eyes.

9
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:47,760
Swipe down on your R1 smart ring to browse the next trains.

10
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:52,610
Tap the ring to flip directions instantly when you are ready to head back.

11
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:58,240
Hold the ring to open the quick menu and track your train without reaching into your pocket.

12
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:03,140
When delays stack up, the next train out is not always the first one home.

13
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:10,410
Headway compares transit times across all trains and flags the overtake: wait for the 511 Express.

14
00:01:10,410 --> 00:01:15,510
The advice appears right on your glasses HUD, saving you four minutes.

15
00:01:15,510 --> 00:01:21,010
And a time-sensitive alert notifies you before you step onto the slower train.

16
00:01:21,010 --> 00:01:24,190
Swipe right on your train to track your ride.

17
00:01:24,190 --> 00:01:30,140
Your Lock Screen and Dynamic Island update in real time with every passing station.

18
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:34,290
Glance at your Apple Watch for a quick countdown on the platform.

19
00:01:34,290 --> 00:01:40,310
Tap Share ETA to send friends a private live map link that requires no login.

20
00:01:40,310 --> 00:01:46,240
As you roll in, a gentle five-minute arrival tap reminds you to gather your things.

21
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:50,390
Never guess. Never sprint. Caltrain on your schedule.

22
00:01:50,390 --> 00:01:53,590
Headway. Your next Caltrain, at a glance.
